      "scope": "Unit",
      "engineArgumentCount": 1,
      "valence": "Positive",
      "description": "Once per game, during this model\u0027s activation, before attacking, place X tokens on one enemy unit within 24\u0022 and in line of sight, or one token on X enemy units within 24\u0022 and in line of sight. When attacking, friendly units may remove one token from their target before rolling to block to get AP(\u002B1) on their weapons."
    },
